 "method_notes": [
  "yearend reproduces the Year-End-only kids figures: same cards, same exclusions, same join tables, same measure predicates (imported from scripts/build_decade_genre_breakdown.py).",
  "side counts only kids-side songs with a valid card in the exported cards.csv. Planned songs without one are `n_unread` and are in no denominator.",
  "full is yearend plus side, songs counted once (a side song is by construction not a Year-End song). shift_pp = 100 x (full share - yearend share).",
  "A side song with a blank lexical column is `unmeasured` on the profanity measure and left out of its denominator.",
  "kids_union is kca, kidz-bop and radio-disney. kca_kidz_bop is kca and kidz-bop only. teen-choice is a teen award, reported alone and never inside either union.",
  "vs_chart compares the group's Year-End hits from 2010 on against every Year-End song from 2010 on, on the same measures. Year-End only on both sides.",
  "Cells below min_n carry reliable=false.",
  "Side cards never enter live/decade-genre-breakdown.json."
 ],
